Third-party material compiled into DeckPilot
--------------------------------------------

Key fonts (crates/deckpilot-render/assets): the device's keys and the
editor's previews are drawn with subsets of these fonts, built by
crates/deckpilot-render/assets/make-fonts.py.

- Inter 4.1 (https://github.com/rsms/inter), Medium and SemiBold, Copyright
  (c) 2016 The Inter Project Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1; the full
  licence is crates/deckpilot-render/assets/Inter-LICENSE.txt.
- Lucide icons 1.72.0 (https://lucide.dev, npm package lucide-static), the
  icons listed in crates/deckpilot-render/assets/icons.txt, Copyright (c)
  2026 Lucide Icons and Contributors, ISC License; the icons derived from
  Feather, Copyright (c) 2013-present Cole Bemis, MIT License. The full
  licence is crates/deckpilot-render/assets/Lucide-LICENSE.txt. The app's
  own icons come from the same set (lucide-react).
